            </note>
            <note corresp="#d198-f3" n="6" xml:id="d198-f3-content">
                <p>Reference is to Executive Order 12036, “United States Intelligence Activities,”
                    signed January 24, 1978. (<hi rendition="#italic">Public Papers: Carter,
                        1978</hi>, Book I, pp. 194–214)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
